<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2026 21:23:38 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>银河宝石在美国宇航局钱德拉的新画廊中闪闪发光</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/galactic-gems-glisten-in-new-gallery-from-nasas-chandra</link><description>该画廊展示了来自钱德拉和其他望远镜的 16 张银河图像集。天文学家将星系分为三大类：像我们银河系一样的螺旋星系、更古老且可能是合并结果的椭圆星系，以及包含广泛星系现象的不规则星系。所有类型都在此集合中表示。每张银河图像都包含来自钱德拉的 X 射线数据以及来自 NASA 韦伯望远镜、哈勃望远镜、IXPE、Swift 和 NuSTAR 以及其他太空和地面望远镜的数据。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/galactic-gems-glisten-in-new-gallery-from-nasas-chandra.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2026 21:23:36 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/galactic-gems-glisten-in-new-gallery-from-nasas-chandra</guid></item><item><title>第一位在实时人工智能辅助下进行脑部手术的患者</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/first-patient-to-have-brain-surgery-with-realtime-ai-assistance</link><description>如果没有实时人工智能辅助引导的脑部手术，里斯·希伯特可能会因肿瘤而失明。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/first-patient-to-have-brain-surgery-with-realtime-ai-assistance.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2026 21:08:36 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/first-patient-to-have-brain-surgery-with-realtime-ai-assistance</guid></item><item><title>西屋反应堆通过临界测试，目标运行八年</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/westinghouse-reactor-passes-criticality-test-targets-8year-run</link><description>西屋公司完成了 eVinci 微反应器的零功耗测试，验证了核心设计模型和假设。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/westinghouse-reactor-passes-criticality-test-targets-8year-run.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2026 20:53:36 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/westinghouse-reactor-passes-criticality-test-targets-8year-run</guid></item><item><title>Nvidia ACIE 收入达到 400 亿美元。内存成本已经在挤压它</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/nvidia-acie-revenue-hit-40-billion-memory-costs-are-already-squeezing-it</link><description>Nvidia 的 ACIE 部门（人工智能云、工业和企业）在 2027 财年第二季度达到 403 亿美元，同比增长 138%，目前占数据中心收入的近一半。同一次财报电话会议还发出了一个更安静的警告：内存短缺正在推高英伟达自身的成本，并可能影响未来几个季度的毛利率。成长是真实的。其背后的成本压力也是如此。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/nvidia-acie-revenue-hit-40-billion-memory-costs-are-already-squeezing-it.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2026 20:38:36 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/nvidia-acie-revenue-hit-40-billion-memory-costs-are-already-squeezing-it</guid></item><item><title>美国宇航局罗马太空望远镜内部技术</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/the-technology-inside-nasas-roman-space-telescope</link><description>与设计、建造和测试新罗马太空望远镜的 NASA 工程师一起打开它的引擎盖。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/the-technology-inside-nasas-roman-space-telescope.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2026 20:23:36 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/the-technology-inside-nasas-roman-space-telescope</guid></item><item><title>物理学家直接成像了真空中的量子涨落</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/physicists-just-directly-imaged-the-quantum-fluctuations-of-empty-space</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2026 20:08:36 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/physicists-just-directly-imaged-the-quantum-fluctuations-of-empty-space</guid></item><item><title>更坚韧的细胞外基质增强大鼠肌腱</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/a-tougher-extracellular-matrix-strengthens-tendons-in-rats</link><description>研究人员发现&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/a-tougher-extracellular-matrix-strengthens-tendons-in-rats.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2026 19:53:36 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/a-tougher-extracellular-matrix-strengthens-tendons-in-rats</guid></item><item><title>超越简单的神经网络模型：扩展平均场理论提供了更好的方法</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/going-beyond-simple-models-of-neural-networks-extended-mean-field-theory-offers-a-better-approach</link><description>物理学最容易应用于相对简单的系统：钟摆、两个电子碰撞或太阳系的结构。但是，当系统变得复杂时——当许多粒子在气体和流体等凝聚态系统中或早期宇宙的宇宙学中相互作用时——可以使用一种称为经典或扩展平均场理论的技术进行简化。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/going-beyond-simple-models-of-neural-networks-extended-mean-field-theory-offers-a-better-approach2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2026 19:38:36 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/going-beyond-simple-models-of-neural-networks-extended-mean-field-theory-offers-a-better-approach</guid></item><item><title>一年前，我走上圣彼得堡的舞台。</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/a-year-ago-i-walked-onto-a-stage-in-st</link><description>&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/a-year-ago-i-walked-onto-a-stage-in-st.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2026 19:23:36 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/a-year-ago-i-walked-onto-a-stage-in-st</guid></item><item><title>为什么我不相信雷·库兹韦尔的预测，但我确信他在听</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/why-im-not-betting-on-ray-kurzweils-predictions-but-im-sure-as-hell-listening</link><description>Ray Kurzweil 是人工智能预报员，准确率“86%”。这个数字值得商榷。但这就是为什么他的想法非常值得一听。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/why-im-not-betting-on-ray-kurzweils-predictions-but-im-sure-as-hell-listening.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2026 19:08:36 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/why-im-not-betting-on-ray-kurzweils-predictions-but-im-sure-as-hell-listening</guid></item></channel></rss>